iNFO
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is simply a colorful ANSI/LIGHTBAR (if you are not familliar with that
phrase then just load the thing and you will see...) pREFS menu for CNet/3.  

(really not much purpose in life, but, hey, it combines the EP/EU/ET/EF/PW)

The color is configurable, and, you can change the pics if you want to.....

NOTE:   The 'sys.prefs' file is the default that is shown if the particular 
        'tt?.prefs' file is not found.  So, put your nicest one here...

Also it adds a line (optional, see .rexx file) DIZ option for FPDIZ by PMK.


DiSCLAiMER
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This CNet/3 mod is provided AS IS.  Adolescent, or 1oo%, makes no claims as
to the problems it could cause.    Modification of this program is strictly 
prohibited, if you need source, please write me a letter and I will provide
you with all the routines you need.


iNSTALL
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1)  Copy the file 'pREFS.rexx' to wherever you want it.  (works best in the
    'PFILES:1oo/pREFS/' dir so it doesn't get lost... 8)

2)  Copy the files 'sys.pREFS' & 'ttx.pREFS' to the 'SYSTEXT:' dir...

3)  Load 'CNET:BBSTEXT' into your best text editor and add the following to
    the end of '2; Available everywhere'

        PRef    |#0pfiles:1oo/pREFS/pREFS.rexx}

    (make sure you put the propper path to where you put the .rexx file...)

4)  Re-load the BBSTEXT/BBSMENU from the pulldown menu.

5)  Type PR or Prefs at any prompt and you are on your way...


